preparation to the limelight of manifestation. When God sees your
diligence in the secret and how you have laboured to build capacity in
the secret, God Himself will announce you and people will SEE you.
every grace and anointing that God has put in you will become visible
to men and people will start placing demand on God's grace on your
life. Remember Luke 8:16-17 ‘No man, when he hath lighted a candle,
