           THE WISDOM OF OWNERSHIP

The total land expanse on earth is 13.003 billion hectares while as at
January 1, 2023, the world population according to the United Nations
is 8,045,311,447. It can be implied from these figures that if land was to
be shared equally to all inhabitants of the earth, each person is entitled
to approximately 1.616 hectares of land. While this is far from what is
obtainable due to many other factors that affect individual access to
available land, the fact still remains that our God is a God of
abundance and everyone on earth has divine right to a wide expanse of
land by God’s design.

Investing in owning a land is a timeless wisdom key. In fact, ownership
of things on earth is God’s principle for man. God introduced himself
as the Owner of Heaven and Earth and He desires that we are owners
on earth. Ps 115:15-16 says: May you be blessed by the Lord, Who made
heaven and earth. The heaven, even the heavens, are the Lord's; But the
earth He has given to the children of men.

God is neither renting nor leasing heaven; He is Owner and He wants
you to be an owner as well. Ps 24:1-2 declares the earth is the Lord's, and
everything in it, the world, and all who live in it; for he founded it upon the
seas and established it upon the waters. God confidently declares in Ps
50:10-12, Every beast of the forest is mine, and the cattle upon a thousand
hills. I know all the fowls of the mountains:

