                 THE WISDOM OF SEED

At creation, God programmed the earth to run by the principle of the
seed. This means that everything that will happen on earth will start as a
seed and grow to maturity. Thus, whatever will happen in a person’s life
or generally on the earth will happen because the seed for it was sown
and nurtured till fruition.

A seed is anything that carries the ability to produce after its kind. A
seed is a substance, action, circumstance or thing that carries the
potential to produce a predetermined bigger reality with time. In
Genesis 1:11 Then God said, "Let the land burst forth with every sort of
grass and seed-bearing plant. And let there be trees that grow seed-bearing
fruit. The seeds will then produce the kinds of plants and trees from which
they came. The land was filled seed-bearing plants and trees, and their
seeds produced plants and trees of like kind. And God saw that it was
good. Every biological life carries in itself a seed which is the power for
