shall burst out with new wine." We must honour God with all our heart
and life. Honouring the Lord involves living a life that pleases him in all

                                                              90
                                           THE WISDOM OF HONOUR

holiness and godliness, it includes giving to Him and devoting your time
to worship and serve Him.

The second level of honour is unto men. Among men, the first
