not produce the accurate results that match up with the effort invested
and the work done; this then result in pain, disappointment and
frustration.

Prayer stems from an understanding that even though nothing works
unless somebody is working on it, there is also the need for a
supernatural intervention that empowers one to sow and reap, even a
hundredfold. Prayer is a conscious partnership with a spirit to bless the
work of one's hands and multiply the results those hands produce.
Wisdom principles are not substitutes for prayer; it is also wisdom to
pray. And to balance up the square, prayer is also not a substitute for
wisdom principles. Prayer is as well a wisdom principle as the others,
and it is chiefly positioned because, it is not just a principle to add on

