                       ABOUT THE BOOK

According to scriptures, Wisdom is the most important thing to get to
ascertain a life of meaning, success and fulfilment. However, Wisdom is
not unilateral but multifaceted and dynamic. Meaning that a person can
be wise in an area of life and absolutely unwise in another. Furthermore,
a person can be wise today and act with astounding foolishness
tomorrow. Thus, knowing and practising wisdom everyday of life and in
every area of life should not be left to chance. The 31 Wisdom Keys gives
profound wisdom capsules for each day and spreads wisdom tentacles
across all areas of life. This book will challenge you to live with the
deliberate consciousness of applying wisdom in every area of your
existence.

